on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  2] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  4] extcall 50 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  6] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(1)>
  [  7] jmpifz [ 19] ............................ if not soundBusy(1) then / else
  [ 10] pushcons 0 .............................. <"instruct">
  [ 12] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"instruct">
  [ 14] extcall 3 ............................... go("instruct")
  [ 16] jmp [ 28]
  [ 19] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 20] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 22] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(0)>
  [ 24] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [ 26] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(0))
  [ 28] ret
end
